n\\begin{aligned}|A-\\lambda I| & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -3 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-1-\\lambda )|\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -3 \\\\ -3 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-1-\\lambda )((1-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-9) & =0 \\\\ (-1-\\lambda )({\\lambda }^{2}-2\\lambda -8) & =0 \\\\ (-1-\\lambda )(\\lambda -4)(\\lambda +2) & =0 \\\\ \\lambda  & =4,\\,-1,\\,-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nmin{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1}=-2.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378702 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378703 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378704 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186378704 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378699 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b79cb6ac-c413-5f59-b2f9-d516aeede4f5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378700 #edb/ref 1080 "2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378700 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378700 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "10e8fb69-9f44-54d0-bd05-804474fc28c4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378701 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378701 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378701 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "72b442c4-0af9-57a0-b12e-baf37ccd0d65" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378702 #edb/ref 1080 "-4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378702 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378702 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "32608b6c-5259-57f3-8578-4b5368a63121" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378703 